# ret_bug_repo.ti59 — Reproduce bug with lost return address
#
# The program is supposed to print this output and then stop:
#          0.
#         10.
#         11.
#
# However, the emulator loses the return address four times, before it finally retains it. This leads to this output:
#          0.
#         10.
#          0.
#         10.
#          0.
#         10.
#          0.
#         10.
#          0.
#         10.
#         11.
#

PROGRAM:
000  25 CLR
001  99 PRT
002  71 SBR
003  00  00
004  10  10
005  25 CLR
006  01  1
007  01  1
008  99 PRT
009  91 R/S
010  25 CLR
011  01  1
012  00  0
013  99 PRT
014  92 RTN
